3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015 </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">호주정부초청 장학생 선발 요강</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">가</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">장학 프로그램 개요</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">Endeavour Postgraduate Scholarship</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">은 대학원이상의 과정 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">코스워크 또는 연구과정</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">지원자를 대상으로 하는 호주 정부 장학 프로그램이다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">수혜자는 석사 과정인 경우 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">박사 과정인 경우 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">4</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년까지 지원되는 전액 장학금 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">생활비와 학비 포함</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">을 받을 수 있으며 학문 영역에 대한 제한이 없다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">나</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">장학 프로그램 종류</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1) Endeavour Postgraduate Scholarship </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2) Endeavour Vocational Education and Training (VET) Scholarship </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">3) Endeavour Research Fellowship </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">4) Endeavour Executive Fellowship </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">자격 조건 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1) </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">프로그램 시작 당시 적어도 만 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">18</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">세 혹은 그 이상이어야 함</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></