raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">11</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">월 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">30</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">일 안에는 시작하여야 하며</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이미 프로그램을 시작하였거나 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년 전에 시작하는 프로그램으로는 신청 할 수 없음</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND